 proposal engine - reviews, boosts, and approves proposals up to your rank, hands-off\nOptimal mode - caps spend to the day's earned surplus + quality gate, so Capital never dips\nSmart branch routing - sends each approved proposal to the city that needs it most   [FIXED: now hits New York City]\nTest log - dry-run that prints every decision before anything fires\n\n[ STAFFING ]\nDepartment balancer - spreads a city's hoarded department out to the cities short on it   [NEW]\nMetric stat-staffing - feeds matching-dept staff into weak cities to lift their stats\nHeadcount rebalance - evens players across branches; NYC fix/drain handled separately\nFaster moves - staffing now acts in larger, quicker passes   [IMPROVED]\n\n[ YOU ]\nRole Sniper - claims a target role the instant it opens + Board/Chairman seat auto-reclaim\nOffice copy - clones any office with in-game cash \nPremium office finder - scans the server for the best-decorated offices to copy\nTeleports - jump to your office, any branch, or a premium office\nShop - claims all free consumables in one click\n\n[ GOVERN + INSIGHT ]\nAnalytics + advisor - per-city stats, history graph, ranked list of what to fix first\nProposal author - creates and boosts proposals to a target level in one step\nDashboard / Board / Chiefs - live company, board, and chief overviews\nPersonnel + Summon - full roster view and staff summoning\nReqs - set your own thresholds for every automation accepted/declined\n\n[ PLATFORM ]\nFull mobile support layout\nAnti-AFK - Roblox and the owns game afk\nSettings + Credits - rebindable show/hide key and tool info","tags":["the company","sim","roleplay"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/d6wdjt6s7w-ux/the-company/main/company-obfuscated%20(2).lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"68c83c9c638b734783147dc4","username":"velocityy","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/68c83c9c638b734783147dc4-1781482087263.png","status":"offline","id":"68c83c9c638b734783147dc4",